    "slot": "questions",
    "title": "Service Questions",
    "version": "1.0",
    "file": "service-questions.md",
    "pages": 1,
    "sha256": "f185dac621b034171442abdc533d2c05a93ae0a59d3444f00c797bb19bae17a8",
    "previews": [],
    "text": "# Service Questions\n\nJuniper Cleaning - fictional demo company\nVersion 1.0 | Effective 22 October 2026\n\n## Service area\nThis demonstration accepts fictional homes in the visitor's selected local timezone. It has no real dispatch area, postcode eligibility check or travel charge. Do not enter a real address. The coordinator view represents a fictional cleaning business.\n\n## Supplies\nJuniper brings ordinary products, cloths, a vacuum and a mop. Ask the coordinator before requesting a particular product or equipment change. The Service Guide and Safety and Exclusions describe the limits of those requests.\n\n## Results and guarantees\nThe guides do not promise a landlord deposit return or a property inspection result. They describe the agreed cleaning scope. Ask for a coordinator review if a requirement goes beyond that scope.\n\n## Booking and CRM\nA submitted request is awaiting review until a coordinator approves it. HubSpot sharing is optional and separate from the reservation. Continuing without CRM creates no CRM records. This is a fictional demonstration; it does not send staff, emails or text messages.\n"
  }
